      "receiptText": "1 lb plums, stoned and chopped\u003Cbr\u003E\n4 oz sugar\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u00BD pint white wine vinegar\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 tablespoon fresh mint, finely chopped\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\nPlace the plums in a saucepan with the sugar and vinegar and bring to the boil. Simmer until the plums are soft, then mash with a fork to produce a rough puree. Stir in the mint, spoon into a sauce boat and serve hot with Saddle of Lamb.\u003Cbr\u003E"
